MinIO is a high-performance, S3-compatible object storage server.
It allows you to store and retrieve files (objects) such as images, videos, PDFs, backups, logs, and other unstructured data.

Think of it as your private version of Amazon S3 that you can run on your own server or in Kubernetes.

Why do we use MinIO?

Instead of storing files directly in a database, we store them in object storage like MinIO.

